## ⚙️ Configuration

Open `slugify.py` in any text editor and modify the variables at the top:

```python
SEPARATOR = '-'            # character between words (e.g., '_' or '+')
LOWERCASE = True           # convert to lowercase (recommended)
REMOVE_STOPWORDS = True    # remove common words (a, an, the, of, etc.)
MAX_LENGTH = 60            # maximum slug length (0 = no limit)
```

